From: postmarketOS gta3xlwifi port
Subject: [PATCH] dril: add exynos7885-dpu to the kmsro drivers

The Exynos7885 DPU KMS driver scans out buffers that Panfrost renders
through kmsro. Add it to the dril kmsro list so the X server's DRI loader
finds exynos7885-dpu_dri.so for glamor/GLX.
---
--- a/src/gallium/targets/dril/dril_target.c
+++ b/src/gallium/targets/dril/dril_target.c
@@ -651,6 +651,7 @@
 DEFINE_LOADER_DRM_ENTRYPOINT(tegra)
 DEFINE_LOADER_DRM_ENTRYPOINT(armada_drm)
 DEFINE_LOADER_DRM_ENTRYPOINT(exynos)
+DEFINE_LOADER_DRM_ENTRYPOINT(exynos7885_dpu)
 DEFINE_LOADER_DRM_ENTRYPOINT(gm12u320)
 DEFINE_LOADER_DRM_ENTRYPOINT(hdlcd)
 DEFINE_LOADER_DRM_ENTRYPOINT(hx8357d)
--- a/src/gallium/targets/dril/meson.build
+++ b/src/gallium/targets/dril/meson.build
@@ -66,6 +66,7 @@
                'apple',
                'armada-drm',
                'exynos',
+               'exynos7885-dpu',
                'gm12u320',
                'hdlcd',
                'hx8357d',
